Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.51,0:01:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've attacked your life\Npoints yet again, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.31,0:01:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I wipe out the rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.39,0:01:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that anchor will drop, taking\Nyou with it right into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.15,0:01:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, I can assure you that\Nyou'll never get away with your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.59,0:01:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.73,0:01:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say you're in no\Nposition to make threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.51,0:01:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the real Joey is in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.05,0:01:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm going to set him free\Nno matter what it takes. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.09,0:01:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you'll win my\Npuzzle or my Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.81,0:01:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just see about that, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.43,0:01:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey belongs to me now,\Nthanks to my Millennium Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So destroy your former best\Nfriend, my mind puppet,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and strip him of all that he has so\Nthat I may rule the world as Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.21,0:01:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, your friend is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.59,0:02:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.49,0:02:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither one of your monsters is powerful\Nenough to defeat my alligator's sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.13,0:02:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.43,0:02:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.77,0:02:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We're your friends,\Nremember? Taya's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.39,0:02:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.59,0:02:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have come up with a way to save\NJoey and get us out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it just came to me when Taya\Nreminded us of our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a chance we can break\Nthrough to the real Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you should let me\Nduel in your place. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.85,0:02:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Because through thick and thin, Joey and\NI have always shared a really strong bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.65,0:02:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A bond that I think might\Nbreak through to him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.09,0:02:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been through so much together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.05,0:02:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the time he rescued\Nme from that fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey and Tristan risked\Ntheir lives for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.99,0:02:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.89,0:02:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a very dangerous match, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it is, but I\Ncan't let that stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.41,0:03:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel in my heart that\Nif there's anyone in the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.09,0:03:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,whole world that can get\Nthrough to Joey right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.63,0:03:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to go in there and\Ndo whatever I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.45,0:03:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's my best friend, and I know that\Nhe would do the exact same thing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.91,0:03:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please understand, Yami, this\Nisn't just something I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.27,0:03:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something I feel I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.33,0:03:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Yugi, if you feel\Nthat strongly, then go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and rescue your best friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and know that I will be right\Nhere should you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.83,0:03:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Joey, it's just us now. What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I want the pharaoh, not this little runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to defeat the ancient\Nruler, that spineless coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He sent Little Yugi to protect himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You cheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to destroy the Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But then again...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be just what I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can win this duel with ease now that I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.17,0:04:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,up against Little Yugi\Ninstead of the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.03,0:04:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And it doesn't really matter\Nwhich one of them I defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll still win the Millennium\NPuzzle and Slifer the Sky Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.97,0:04:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn, Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.21,0:04:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya and Joey are counting on you\NAnd as long as you believe in the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.15,0:04:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart of the Cards I know you'll\Ncome through for them Right Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart of the Cards Please guide me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Joey's Red-Eyes Black\NDragon. This is my only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.23,0:04:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight, Serenity You\Ncan't run forever Wanna bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.69,0:04:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do. Nice try, kid. What\Nare we going to do, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.81,0:04:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to take\Na little trip with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you come quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.43,0:04:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:04:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're even more foolish than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.35,0:05:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be careful, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we're going to have\Nto do this the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.93,0:05:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You guessed right, so bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say we didn't warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.27,0:05:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have given up\Nwhen you had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.09,0:05:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But now it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me go! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's more where that came from,\Ntough guy What's going on, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is that Duke Devlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The one and only
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.59,0:05:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Serenity, hang on Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how you been, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk later, run now Right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They're getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.87,0:05:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,After all
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I drew the card Joey gave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,His Red Eyes Black Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, how should I use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.15,0:05:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you may be able to use that card to\Nsave Joey, but you must play it wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:05:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This Red Eyes has always\Nbeen special to Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.39,0:06:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to remember it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.79,0:06:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.70,0:06:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey gave me this card so I'd always\Nhave a piece of him in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he sees it, the real\NJoey will break through!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it better work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're in there somewhere, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope that you're\Npaying close attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'm about to jog\Nyour memory with an old
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,friend of yours that's\Nnot too easy to forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.55,0:06:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,your Red-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.15,0:06:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, when time runs out, that\Nanchor falls, so make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.71,0:06:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, in order to summon Red-Eyes,\NI'll need to sacrifice two monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I've got Karibo and\NBig Shield Gardner on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.29,0:06:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is send them to the\Ngraveyard, and I can bring out red-eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes. Yugi, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want\Nto summon red-eyes now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.61,0:06:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick may have something\Nthat can destroy it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and with only 1,500 life points\Nleft, we must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.65,0:06:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as they reach zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:07:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,that anchor will pull us into the ocean,\Nand the entire world will be in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, what's taking so long? Yami's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoning red-eyes is too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe there's a way I can show this card\Nto Joey Without actually summoning it to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,the field But it might be an even riskier\Nmove I'm not sure what to do All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time to sink or swim Quite literally
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.69,0:07:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a way to get\Nthrough to Joey He's our friend
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.39,0:07:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We've all been through so much\Ntogether Joey's always said that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,whenever he's down His friends\Ngive him the strength to get
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,back up again And I know our\Nfriendship can save him now Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,please wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.71,0:07:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta remember our bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this is the symbol\Nof our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.47,0:07:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I know marker ink will\Neventually fade away,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.45,0:07:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't matter because this ring\Nis never going to vanish at our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember our ring of friendship?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can break that bond, so\Nsnap out of it, Joey, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what the risks\Nare, Joey is my friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.11,0:08:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have to do whatever it takes to\Nbreak Merrick's control and save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we made a pact that\NI'd always be there for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and he'd always be there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'd never break a promise\Nto a friend, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So now it's time to show Merrick\Nwhat friendship's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.81,0:08:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the Magic Card Exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A foolish move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.57,0:08:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Yugi thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The exchange card allows Wheeler to\Ntake any card he wants from Yugi's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.69,0:08:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be desperate to\Nplay a card like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.19,0:08:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you insist, I'd be glad to take\Na card from your hand, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.01,0:08:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I need any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.37,0:08:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me your pitiful cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, which card shall I take? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My red eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.03,0:08:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're under my control now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no mind of your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.41,0:09:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I own you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing an exchange card was\Na huge mistake, little Yuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, pick your card, Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have anyone you want,\Nincluding the red-eyes black dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.05,0:09:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the card I gave Yuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My red eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.21,0:09:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in control of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, it may be working.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi needs that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I gave it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You will do as I say and take that\Nred-eyes black dragon from Yugi now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no mind of your own, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.59,0:09:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no mind of my own. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.49,0:09:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So take Yugi's red eyes right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, my obedient\Nmind puppet. Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend is long gone, so I'll be\Ntaking your Red-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.53,0:09:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still under Merrick's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.69,0:10:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Yugi. Look again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take Red-Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Yugi's card now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.73,0:10:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.53,0:10:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.91,0:10:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you, take\Nthe Red-Eyes from Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.09,0:10:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Obey me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that card so we can\Nfinish Yu-Gi off now! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi needs it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.03,0:10:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! Yeah, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.83,0:10:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you disobey me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this! Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.47,0:10:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, Joey has gone away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.77,0:10:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm here to defeat you with my\Narsenal of rare magic cards. So I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,need your red eyes That's what you think\NNow I get to pick one of your cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I said, Joey is gone. And\Nyou're finished. We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You can deny it all you\Nwant But I know my best
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.61,0:11:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,friend is in there And\NI'm gonna set him free,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.05,0:11:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, you're fooling\Nyourself. I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.17,0:11:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you didn't take\Nmy red eyes Cause the real
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.25,0:11:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey is in there fighting\Nto get out, and he gave me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,that red eyes when he promised\Nto help me defeat you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.11,0:11:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.11,0:11:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Admit it. As\Nsoon as he saw that card,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.35,0:11:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,the real Joey came through\NWhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm controlling his\Nmind Not for much longer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.01,0:11:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I can use this\Ncard to stop you and bring
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My best friend back. Just\Nwait. Don't hold your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get on with\Nthis duel already so I can
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,clean what is mine and get\Nrid of you once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.95,0:11:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still my turn, so stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.49,0:11:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and make your\Npathetic move, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.99,0:11:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a card in\Nyour hand that can stop
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,me from wiping out the\Nrest of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I sacrifice my two monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can summon this to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.23,0:12:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-Eyes Black Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's my red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, that's right, Joey. Fight it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.47,0:12:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at your red eyes and break free!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.35,0:12:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm losing control of my mind slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My power over him is slipping away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let that little brat Yugi\Nstop the power of my Millennium Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I'm afraid Joey\NWheeler's sister got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.93,0:12:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are you standing here, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.39,0:12:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Go see to it that she is captured. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.19,0:12:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you remember your red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember my dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.07,0:12:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That red-eyes black dragon seems\Nto be affecting Wheeler's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you heard, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:12:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It used to be Joey's card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be a hard spot to be in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A card you really care about\Nbeing played against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about to get harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.79,0:13:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick has taken over your mind\Nand he's using you to destroy me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.55,0:13:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna try to blast you back\Nto your senses. If it doesn't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.25,0:13:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,you, me, and the whole world are in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.87,0:13:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only doing this\Nbecause I'm your friend
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.33,0:13:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now prepare to be knocked\Nback to your senses
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-Eyes Black Dragon, attack his\Nalligator sword with Inferno Fire Blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.35,0:13:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up and fight back, Mind Slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey! Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.71,0:13:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.17,0:13:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your trick didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.51,0:13:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.13,0:13:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wipe out what's left of your\Nlife points, my little friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.39,0:14:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And take what belongs to me. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.21,0:14:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll attack him with everything we have,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and soon the power of\Nthe Pharaoh will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, this is getting too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't let you, Yami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.11,0:14:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to do this myself,\Nand I have one last idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.53,0:14:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to trust me on this one,\Nbecause I know I can save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the day I put together the\NMillennium Puzzle, you've given me hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,courage, and confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You've even helped me to make new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't go through\Nmy life depending on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know that even without the\NMillennium Puzzle hanging around my neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still be brave\Nand help out my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess what I'm saying is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I need to prove to myself that\NI can be like you without you, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.59,0:14:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.67,0:14:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you understand that I\Nneed to finish this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.05,0:15:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You are aware of what will\Nhappen if you lose this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.17,0:15:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.77,0:15:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I need to do this,\Nbecause I can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.37,0:15:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you believe in yourself, then I\Nbelieve in you too, Yugi. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.61,0:15:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the power to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.53,0:15:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the world rests with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.91,0:15:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won't disappoint\Nyou, Yami. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.37,0:15:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to save my best\Nfriend and the world on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you given up Or\Nare you ready for more?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.55,0:15:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have much time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.49,0:15:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My life points are low, and if\NI lose, Merrick gets everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.15,0:15:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My only hope is to free Joey's mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.81,0:15:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, it's time for\Nme to finish you off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.55,0:15:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And take the power I deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.85,0:15:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.77,0:15:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,As I attack your life points again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,With yet another Inokama magic card!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.81,0:15:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire shower attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.53,0:16:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.27,0:16:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be close. Let's keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't hide forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find you, fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're the fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, a chance to catch our breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.53,0:16:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And catch up while we're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.05,0:16:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, the last time I saw you, Duke,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,was when you were showing off that\NDungeon Dice Monsters game you created.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I heard about this whole\NBattle City thing that's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.05,0:16:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounded like fun, so I decided\Nto stop by and check things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.75,0:16:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was actually hoping to run into\NYugi, but I guess you guys will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.87,0:16:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, who's she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.95,0:16:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,To you, she's off limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember Joey Wheeler, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.49,0:16:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.73,0:16:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't he the guy I made dress\Nup in that doggy costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but do me a favor\Nand don't bring that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll upset Serenity. Fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.69,0:17:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,now that that's all cleared up\NWho were those guys chasing us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't like the\Nlook of those punks I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.93,0:17:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,wonder what those robed\Nfreaks were after anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.21,0:17:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.39,0:17:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can definitely tell you one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.35,0:17:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,though They weren't very fond\Nof you guys Wow, Sherlock,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.63,0:17:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you're real smart, pal Did you\Nfigure that out all by yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.35,0:17:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,or did someone help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.05,0:17:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Very funny Well, someone's after\Nyou, and you need to figure out why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.93,0:17:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, if those jerks are\Nafter us, does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.93,0:17:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mean what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.39,0:17:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That they're after the others, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, Teya, and Yugi may be in\Neven more trouble than we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, little Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did my direct attack leave you speechless?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Joey, come to your senses!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, Mokuba, can't you guys\Ndo something to stop this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we move, Taya will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we've got to stop this\Nwhole thing before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.67,0:17:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.58,0:18:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender yet, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.21,0:18:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm not going to stop until\Nmy best friend is safe from harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know just how to get through\Nto him, Merrick, so watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.95,0:18:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to send you into the\Nsea when I summon Rocket Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Any monster struck by\NRocket Warrior loses 500
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.67,0:18:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,attack points for the duration\Nof the turn Wait Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, you can hear me. And then I'll\Nplay attrition. I know you'll remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.83,0:18:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,think Joey I said you're too\Nlate you fool, Rocket Warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,attack now In its invincible mode it will
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.67,0:18:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,weaken your red eyes\Nwhile remaining unhaused
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to give you something of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.09,0:18:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my attrition card activates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.73,0:18:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes the attack points of my rocket
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,warrior and subtracts\Nthem from your red eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,making it even weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.97,0:19:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.95,0:19:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel my control weakening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.07,0:19:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.01,0:19:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like you gave me your red eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to give you something\Nthat's meaningful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.06,0:19:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.43,0:19:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.07,0:19:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.73,0:19:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.29,0:19:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my most precious possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now a piece of me will always be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.29,0:19:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your love
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.19,0:19:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You kill me, you kill me
